  "iterations": "Initial source-material checks found alpha251..254 within the original kit concepts and252..253 in the earlier ammunition paper region, so neither was installed as a kit texture. Reuse the existing opaque kitchen paper and ammunition metal regions instead. Initial model: folded wrappers, recessed case mouths, sealed abstract packets and decorative projectile/shot; native visual review pending. Initial geometry checks found repeated-profile UV coordinates outside their source rectangle and a wrapper blocking case-mouth rays. Normalize the recessed-case UVs, lower the front wrapper lip and keep its rear raised. Native preview01 showed overly regular tray/packet shapes; deepen asymmetrical wrapper folds and gather/fold packet closures for preview02. Existing opaque materials remain unchanged.",
