  "qualifications": [
    "Candidate art: regular wrapper outline and gathered/folded packets, pale paper contrast, coarse bronze mottling, simple gray shot and projected/wrap seams require author review. Flat ambient lighting makes the shallow mouths and paper folds less legible.",
    "Ten detail views, the floor overview and both presentation scenes were inspected; visual02 tested the same final mesh bytes over #745. Continuity/presentation use installed kits01. Final kits02 only restores MODELDEF to the existing CRLF checkout policy; normalized content and all other package bytes are independently identical. Full project validation preceded this line-ending-only correction; index, package/source and filtered checkout bytes were checked afterward.",
    "A single sequential700-tic two-object pair measures queue intervals only, not GPU/display timing, repeatability, campaign or crowd performance; projected footprints differ.",
    "Native pickup/toss APIs and prepared Box/quest state do not prove ordinary menus, chemistry crafting or author acceptance.",
    "Paper, case, sealed packet and projectile/shot are decoration of the original indivisible kit, not new products, quantities, loading ratios or recipes. Existing icons, tiers, lots/provenance, weights, collision and save schema remain.",
    "Broader inventory, characters, modular equipment and V5.16 campaign remain unfinished. No executable, IWAD, PK3/WAD, DLL or save committed."
  ],
